            ^"Level" INTEGER 5
            ^"Section" STRING "Norman Histories"
            ^"Printed Entry" STRING "Historia Normannorum, by William of Jumieges (1025-1090) includes an Area Lore: Normandy summa of Quality 9 and Level 5; and an Area Lore: England tractatus of Quality 7. Some copies include a final chapter (an Area Lore: Normandy tractatus of Quality 8) added anonymously after the author’s death, which updated the history to 1137."
            ^"Source" STRING "The Lion and the Lily"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 55
        }
    }

